{"product":{"id":9343850217724,"title":"POLYGON - Woodland Apocalypse Map","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ciframe class=\"ratio-16-by-9\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/R8kQA0xFuSo\" title=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/iframe\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSynty® Studios presents: POLYGON - Woodland Apocalypse Map\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThis pack requires: \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/syntystore.com\/products\/polygon-apocalypse-pack\"\u003ePOLYGON Apocalypse Pack\u003c\/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/syntystore.com\/products\/polygon-alpine-mountain-nature-biomes\"\u003eAlpine Mountain Nature Biome\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis map pack is an expansion add-on for Apocalypse Pack and Alpine Mountain Nature Biome, featuring a new demo scene, and a few new assets created just for this map pack. Synty map packs are designed to help inspire you with level design, and save you time with pre-dressed areas ready to place into your project!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIn this map pack you will find an overgrown, post-apocalyptic alpine town, showing signs of desperate survival. Amongst the trees you’ll find a truck stop, diner, lake cabins, a motel, and more!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e30+ new prefabs \/ models\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e6 new apocalyptic decals\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e7 new areas ready to place into your project\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLevels designed for adventure and combat\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eGeneric assets folder with 350+ prefabs including buildings, props, environment, weapons, and FX\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e*Contents may vary between engines\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e📦 Pack Content\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eProps:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e34 props including broken trucks, signs, fencing, foliage and table clutter\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDecals:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e6 decals including warning signs and messages\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMap Areas:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTruck stop, diner, motel, lake cabins, survivors' safehouse, bait shop, and a landfill\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e🤖 Technical Info\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 42, 0);\"\u003eThis pack requires: \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/syntystore.com\/products\/polygon-apocalypse-pack\"\u003ePOLYGON Apocalypse Pack\u003c\/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/syntystore.com\/products\/polygon-alpine-mountain-nature-biomes\"\u003eAlpine Mountain Nature Biome\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e◼ \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibi